"<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C03 c03-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg class=\"c03-p2-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 530\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"정면 유도 축과 순간 전기벡터 X의 방향 모식도\"><defs><marker id=\"c03p2arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10Z\" fill=\"#111\"></path></marker></defs><text x=\"18\" y=\"32\">정면 유도 축 · X: 순간 전기벡터(정규화 모형)</text><path d=\"M155 230L445 230\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#c03p2arrow)\"></path><text x=\"457\" y=\"235\">I (+)</text><path d=\"M227.5 104.4263164512564L372.5 355.5736835487436\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#c03p2arrow)\"></path><text x=\"384.5\" y=\"330.5736835487436\">II (+)</text><path d=\"M300 85L300 375\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#c03p2arrow)\"></path><text x=\"312\" y=\"380\">aVF (+)</text><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"230\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#111\"></circle><path d=\"M300 230L245.00000000000003 325.2627944162883\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" marker-end=\"url(#c03p2arrow)\"></path><text x=\"220.00000000000003\" y=\"361.24355652982143\">X</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"434\">화살표는 각 유도의 양의 방향이다.</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"488\">길이는 실제 mV가 아니다.</text></svg></div></div>"